# Visual consistency (kochfit-redesign)

## 1. Never mix mobile and desktop (hard rule)

Changing **mobile must not edit desktop**. Changing **desktop must not edit mobile**.
Sibling-page ports (`/` `/community` `/for_pregnant` `/r` `/e_mtd`) still **respect breakpoints** — copy the *pattern*, not a class that hits both.

Desktop = Figma `xl:` (**1200px**, `--breakpoint-xl: 75rem` in `@theme`). If the section’s desktop layout is gated with `lg:` (ExpectCourse, WhenToStart), restore there. Mobile = default + `max-xl:` only.

- Tokens are always a **pair**: `--plaque-py-mobile` vs `--plaque-py-desktop`. Never one `py` / radius / font for all viewports.
- Restore desktop with `xl:` (or `lg:` if that is the desktop gate) or `@media (min-width: 1200px)`.
- Do **not** use `sm:` / `md:` as “desktop”. `sm:py-3` applies through xl unless `xl:` overrides it.
- Do **not** unify heights across breakpoints. Hero photos, ProgramCards / PregnancyProgram **188px** on desktop, fit-card 72 vs 90 — stay per breakpoint.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — one class, both viewports; desktop Figma lost
className="rounded-full py-[4px]"
className="sm:py-3" // hits xl

// ✅ GOOD — mobile tweak + explicit desktop original
className="py-1 xl:py-[6px] rounded-full xl:rounded-[139px]"
className="py-1.5 sm:max-xl:py-3 xl:py-[16px]"
```

```css
/* ❌ BAD — 6px from 640px up, desktop Figma lost */
.plaque { padding: 4px 10px; }
@media (min-width: 640px) { .plaque { padding-block: 6px; } }

/* ✅ GOOD */
.plaque { padding: var(--plaque-py-mobile) var(--plaque-px-mobile); }
@media (min-width: 1200px) {
  .plaque { padding: var(--plaque-py-desktop) var(--plaque-px-desktop); }
}
```

Edit the matching token in `src/app/globals.css` (mobile *or* desktop). Do not invent a new `py` / `rounded-*` on one landing for a pill that already has a class.

## When the user changes one page

Search siblings, grep the copy (e.g. «Старт с момента покупки»), apply the **same class**, then change the **matching token/breakpoint** — not a one-off that leaks.

| Class | Mobile | Desktop (xl, or lg if that is the gate) |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `.plaque` | py **8px**, radius 7px | py **8px** (tariff / price chips) |
| `.course-catalog-tag` | py **4px** | py **6px** |
| `.plaque-chip` | py **8px**, `rounded-full` | py **10px**, px **12px**, **`rounded-[139px]`** |
| `.plaque-feature` | py **4px**, 11px type | py **4px**, 12px type (lg+) |
| `.plaque-label` | py **5px**, px **12px**, 11px type | py **6px**, px **10px**, 10px type, radius 28px (lg+) |
| `.fit-card` | min-height **72px** | height **90px** only at xl |
| `.hscroll-bleed` | inset via first/last child | never padding-inline on the scroller |

Colors only from `globals.css`. Never green/olive.

## Do not unify / do not restyle

Hero photo crops (`object-position`) — mobile crop must not move the desktop girl. ProgramCards / PregnancyProgram desktop **188px**. PhoneMockup. Equipment covers.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — new padding on one landing
<span className="rounded-[8px] px-3 py-[5px] text-[11px]">Старт с момента покупки</span>

// ✅ GOOD
<span className="plaque bg-surface-blue text-plaque">Старт с момента покупки</span>
```
